title: Infoblox: DNS zones
agents: infoblox_csp
catalog: cloud/infoblox
license: GPLv2
distribution: mkp
description:
 Reports the number of authoritative zones in the tenant, how many are
 disabled, how many are reporting warnings raised by Infoblox itself, and
 how many are DNSSEC signed.

 The service goes {WARN} when any zone is disabled or reporting a warning.
 Both states are configurable. Disabled and warning zones are named in the
 details.

discovery:
 One aggregate service is created on the tenant host. Individual zones do
 not become services, because a tenant can hold thousands of them.
